# docs/PICT_CENSUS.md § S3 — byok-vs-platform-key-resolution
# Local-inference baseUrl precedence (mergeLocalInferenceFromEnv) and vLLM apiKey
# resolution (createAIProviderRegistry): fleet > user > env for vLLM baseUrl;
# user > env > default for vLLM apiKey. Ollama has no fleet override.
Provider:       vllm, ollama
FleetBaseUrl:   set, unset
UserBaseUrl:    set, unset
EnvBaseUrl:     set, unset
UserApiKey:     set, unset
PlatformKey:    set, unset

IF [Provider] = "ollama" THEN [FleetBaseUrl] = "unset";
IF [Provider] = "ollama" THEN [UserApiKey] = "unset";
IF [Provider] = "ollama" THEN [PlatformKey] = "unset";
